cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the method it implements
  (preferred-citation) and, where appropriate, this implementation.
title: "vectorfield_nav2: constructive vector-field navigation for ROS 2 Nav2"
abstract: >-
  ROS 2 implementation of the constructive time-varying artificial vector
  fields of Rezende, Gonçalves and Pimenta (IEEE T-RO 2022): a Nav2
  controller plugin, a curve-following action server, a ROS-free C++ core
  and Python tools.
type: software
